  "text": {
    "intro": "The Inverlaig ferry runs a full day of crossings in theory, and a variable number in practice.\nFive skippers are involved. Determine each skipper's start time and cargo.\n- **Skipper**: Fearghas, Eilidh, Ruaridh, Calla and Murdo.\n- **Start time** (listed from earlier to later): 8am, 9am, 10am, 11am and noon.\n- **Notable cargo**: a refrigerated van, a brass band, a consignment of bees, a church organ and a wedding party.\nEvery skipper has a different start time and cargo, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "Calla sails at noon.",
      "Fearghas carries a wedding party.",
      "Ruaridh carries a refrigerated van.",
      "The skipper who carries a consignment of bees sails at 9am.",
      "Murdo is earlier than 9am in start time order.",
      "Fearghas is exactly one hour earlier than the skipper who carries a brass band, with no start time in between."
